  "description": "At Wandol University, getting rejected is harder than getting in. That’s where Ko Hwansu ends up, alone in a small town far from home, while his older brothers at Hanguk University never let him forget it. Hwansu is set on retaking the college entrance exam and transferring out, but with zero support from his family or even his own school, he’s stuck catching naps in whatever corner of campus he can find. \n\nWhich is how he gets caught crashing in the Literary Society club room. Kim Kiyun, the president, offers the homeless freshman a place to stay, on one condition: catching all the rule-breakers sneaking in to have sex in the club room. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
